# Environment variables — Freedom Paws

Copy to `.env.local` for local production testing, or set in Vercel/hosting dashboard.

```bash
# preview = blocks search engines, shows private banner (use until LLC/TM launch)
# public = normal indexing when you are ready to announce
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_MODE=preview

# Admin login for /admin/symptoms symptom lexicon review
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-strong-password-here
```

Optional (when you add AI keys):

```bash
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=
```
